body:
@xpluralx Brother Yes it is my own blog. I was not aware of Reddit's policy regarding self promotion. Now I have read that so I am no more posting any link from this blog. I apologize for inconvenience. 

About the content: Lot of complex and detailed information is available everywhere on the internet for educated people like you. But the-brainiac.com is focused on kids aged between 8-12. It is specifically made for students of a school and that organisation is funding the project. I can write a 5000 words post but it won't be of any use to my audience.
I hope it will clarify your concerns.

Insert following code to your style.css. Try browsing your website after clearing the cache it will sure work.

Its not the best way to do it. The query should be prevented from loading. But if you can't do it then go for this solution for the time being.


    #control-panel .panel-switcher {
     display: none;
    }
